# Line endings.
#
# Docker builds and GitHub Actions runners are Linux. A Dockerfile, an entrypoint
# script, or a shell heredoc inside a workflow that arrives with CRLF fails there
# in confusing ways ("/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter"), and Git on Windows will
# happily convert them on checkout unless told otherwise. Pin the files that
# cross into Linux to LF regardless of the cloner's core.autocrlf setting.

Dockerfile        text eol=lf
*.dockerfile      text eol=lf
.dockerignore     text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf
*.yml             text eol=lf
*.yaml            text eol=lf
*.sh              text eol=lf

# Binary artifacts: never touch, never diff as text.
*.png binary
